    "aa_gate_note": "PRD FR-10 ('Open SAC/SHC only on deficiency or negative outcome', T2.3) and \u00a76 pattern note: the 'AA' (as applicable) gate on the SCR+EVC+AA pattern \u2014 SHC/SAC opens only when the earlier outcome has a deficiency or a negative scrutiny result. The gate answers 'is SHC due?' as open / closed / needs_review. An undecided or unrecognised scrutiny result is 'needs_review', never a guessed open or closed (missing data must not silently pass). The result vocabulary ('nil_deficiency' / 'deficiency') is taken from PRD FR-14's own wording, not invented. Advisory like the rest of this section \u2014 the answer is input to the stage graph, never a transition this service performs.",
